    {
      "id": "design_system",
      "body": "Define the site's design system: full-viewport terminal aesthetic with\ndesign tokens (monospace type scale, phosphor palette at WCAG AA contrast,\nspacing grid), semantic HTML rules, keyboard focus and reduced-motion\nbehaviour. Accessibility is a constraint, not a variant.",
      "actions": [],
      "choices": [],
      "divert": {
