    {
      "id": "write_content",
      "body": "Write the documentation pages: what-it-is overview, getting started, DSL\nsyntax reference, worked examples, use-cases, and the execution/state\nworkflow in practice. Content is distilled from docs/ and verified against\nthe real CLI, not paraphrased from memory.",
